# Downloaded build inputs.
/data/*

# JAO's terms reserve all reproduction rights and forbid redistributing Content; this repository
# is public, so no JAO-derived bytes are committed — not the tables, not captured API responses.
# `python -m coppersushi.data_sources.jao fetch <day>` refills the first; the tests run on
# synthesised look-alikes in tests/fixtures/synthetic-jao/.
/data/jao/
/tests/fixtures/jao/
/wiki/.obsidian/
*.code-workspace

# Unsanctioned solves; `python -m coppersushi.data_sources.pypsa_eur promote <file>` moves one into networks/ (LFS).
networks/candidates/

# Implementation plans are working documents, not deliverables: they are amended as the work
# teaches us things, so a checked-in copy differs per branch and goes stale on the lower ones.
docs/superpowers/plans/
